   ("The 3 Quls: Al-Ikhlas, Al-Falaq, An-Nas", "QULS", "Recite the three surahs: Qul huwallāhu aḥad... Qul a`ūdhu bi-rabbil-falaq... Qul a`ūdhu bi-rabbin-nās...",
    "Reciting these three surahs three times in the morning and evening is enough to protect you from everything.", "Yeh teen surtein subah aur shaam teen teen martaba parhna har cheez se hifazat ke liye kaafi hai.", "3", "Abu Dawud; At-Tirmidhi (Hisn al-Muslim 76). See the full text on our <a href=\"../ayatul-kursi-and-4-quls/\" class=\"in-link\">Ayatul Kursi and 4 Quls</a> page."),
   ("Asbahna wa Asbahal Mulku Lillah", "أَصْبَحْنَا وَأَصْبَحَ الْمُلْكُ لِلَّهِ وَالْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ، لاَ إِلَهَ إلاَّ اللَّهُ وَحْدَهُ لاَ شَرِيكَ لَهُ، لَهُ الْمُلْكُ وَلَهُ الْحَمْدُ وَهُوَ عَلَى كُلِّ شَيْءٍ قَدِيرٌ، رَبِّ أَسْأَلُكَ خَيْرَ مَا فِي هَذَا الْيَوْمِ وَخَيرَ مَا بَعْدَهُ، وَأَعُوذُ بِكَ مِنْ شَرِّ مَا فِي هَذَا الْيَوْمِ وَشَرِّ مَا بَعْدَهُ، رَبِّ أَعُوذُ بِكَ مِنَ الْكَسَلِ وَسُوءِ الْكِبَرِ، رَبِّ أَعُوذُ بِكَ مِنْ عَذَابٍ فِي النَّارِ وَعَذَابٍ فِي القَبْر.",
    "Aṣbaḥnā wa aṣbaḥal-mulku lillāh, wal-ḥamdu lillāh, lā ilāha illallāhu waḥdahu lā sharīka lah, lahul-mulku wa lahul-ḥamd, wa huwa `alā kulli shay'in qadīr. Rabbi as'aluka khayra mā fī hādhal-yawmi wa khayra mā ba`dah, wa a`ūdhu bika min sharri mā fī hādhal-yawmi wa sharri mā ba`dah. Rabbi a`ūdhu bika minal-kasali wa sū'il-kibar. Rabbi a`ūdhu bika min `adhābin fin-nāri wa `adhābin fil-qabr.",
    "(In the evening say: Amsaynā wa amsal-mulku lillāh, and \"this night\" instead of \"this day\".) We have entered the morning, and all sovereignty belongs to Allah. All praise is for Allah. There is no god but Allah alone, with no partner; His is the dominion and His is the praise, and He has power over all things. My Lord, I ask You for the good of this day and the good of what follows it, and I seek Your protection from the evil of this day and the evil of what follows it. My Lord, I seek Your protection from laziness and the hardships of old age. My Lord, I seek Your protection from punishment in the Fire and punishment in the grave.",
    "Hum ne subah ki aur saari badshahi Allah ki hai, aur tamam tareef Allah ke liye hai. Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahin, woh akela hai, Us ka koi shareek nahin, badshahi aur tareef Usi ki hai aur woh har cheez par qadir hai. Ae mere Rab, main Tujh se is din ki bhalai aur is ke baad ki bhalai mangta hoon, aur is din ki buraai aur is ke baad ki buraai se Teri panah mangta hoon. Ae mere Rab, main susti aur budhape ki takleef se Teri panah mangta hoon. Ae mere Rab, main jahannam ke azaab aur qabr ke azaab se Teri panah mangta hoon.", "1", "Sahih Muslim (Hisn al-Muslim 77)"),
   ("Allahumma Bika Asbahna", "اللّهُمَّ بِكَ أَصْبَحْنا وَبِكَ أَمْسَينا وَبِكَ نَحْيا وَبِكَ نَموتُ وَإِلَيْكَ النِّشور",
    "Allāhumma bika aṣbaḥnā, wa bika amsaynā, wa bika naḥyā, wa bika namūt, wa ilaykan-nushūr. (Evening: Allāhumma bika amsaynā, wa bika aṣbaḥnā, wa bika naḥyā, wa bika namūt, wa ilaykal-maṣīr.)",
    "O Allah, by You we enter the morning and by You we enter the evening, by You we live and by You we die, and to You is the resurrection. (In the evening: ...and to You is the final return.)",
    "Ae Allah, Teri hi madad se hum ne subah ki aur Teri hi madad se shaam ki, Tere hi hukm se hum jeete hain aur marte hain, aur Teri hi taraf uth kar jana hai.", "1", "At-Tirmidhi (Hisn al-Muslim 78)"),
   ("Sayyid al-Istighfar", "اللّهمَّ أَنْتَ رَبِّي لا إلهَ إلاّ أَنْتَ خَلَقْتَني وَأَنا عَبْدُك وَأَنا عَلى عَهْدِكَ وَوَعْدِكَ ما اسْتَطَعْت أَعوذُ بِكَ مِنْ شَرِّ ما صَنَعْت أَبوءُ لَكَ بِنِعْمَتِكَ عَلَيَّ وَأَبوءُ بِذَنْبي فَاغْفِرْ لي فَإِنَّهُ لا يَغْفِرُ الذُّنوبَ إِلاّ أَنْتَ",
    "Allāhumma anta rabbī lā ilāha illā ant, khalaqtanī wa ana `abduk, wa ana `alā `ahdika wa wa`dika mastaṭa`t, a`ūdhu bika min sharri mā ṣana`t, abū'u laka bini`matika `alayya, wa abū'u bidhanbī faghfir lī, fa innahū lā yaghfirudh-dhunūba illā ant.",
    "O Allah, You are my Lord; there is no god but You. You created me and I am Your servant, and I keep Your covenant and promise as much as I can. I seek Your protection from the evil of what I have done. I acknowledge Your blessings upon me and I admit my sins, so forgive me, for none forgives sins except You.",
    "Ae Allah, Tu mera Rab hai, Tere siwa koi mabood nahin. Tu ne mujhe paida kiya aur main Tera banda hoon, aur main apni taaqat ke mutabiq Tere ahad aur waade par qaim hoon. Main apne kiye ki buraai se Teri panah mangta hoon. Main apne upar Teri nematon ka iqrar karta hoon aur apne gunahon ka bhi iqrar karta hoon, pas mujhe maaf farma de, kyunke Tere siwa koi gunah maaf nahin kar sakta.", "1", "Sahih al-Bukhari (Hisn al-Muslim 79)"),
   ("For wellbeing", "اللّهُمَّ عافِني في بَدَني، اللّهُمَّ عافِني في سَمْعي، اللّهُمَّ عافِني في بَصَري، لا إلهَ إلاّ اللّه أَنْتَ. اللّهُمَّ إِنّي أَعوذُ بِكَ مِنَ الْكُفر، وَالفَقْر، وَأَعوذُ بِكَ مِنْ عَذابِ القَبْر، لا إلهَ إلاّ أَنْتَ.",
    "Allāhumma `āfinī fī badanī, Allāhumma `āfinī fī sam`ī, Allāhumma `āfinī fī baṣarī, lā ilāha illā ant. Allāhumma innī a`ūdhu bika minal-kufri wal-faqr, wa a`ūdhu bika min `adhābil-qabr, lā ilāha illā ant.",
    "O Allah, grant me wellbeing in my body. O Allah, grant me wellbeing in my hearing. O Allah, grant me wellbeing in my sight. There is no god but You. O Allah, I seek Your protection from disbelief and poverty, and I seek Your protection from the punishment of the grave. There is no god but You.",
    "Ae Allah, mere jism ko aafiyat de. Ae Allah, meri sunne ki taaqat ko aafiyat de. Ae Allah, meri nazar ko aafiyat de. Tere siwa koi mabood nahin. Ae Allah, main kufr aur gurbat se Teri panah mangta hoon, aur qabr ke azaab se Teri panah mangta hoon. Tere siwa koi mabood nahin.", "3", "Abu Dawud; Ahmad (Hisn al-Muslim 82)"),
   ("For protection from all harm", "بِسمِ اللهِ الذي لا يَضُرُّ مَعَ اسمِهِ شَيءٌ في الأرْضِ وَلا في السّماءِ وَهوَ السّميعُ العَليم",
    "Bismillāhil-ladhī lā yaḍurru ma`asmihī shay'un fil-arḍi wa lā fis-samā', wa huwas-samī`ul-`alīm.",
    "In the name of Allah, with whose name nothing on earth or in the heavens can cause harm, and He is the All-Hearing, the All-Knowing.",
    "Allah ke naam se, jis ke naam ke saath zameen aur aasman mein koi cheez nuqsan nahin pohncha sakti, aur woh sab kuch sunne wala, sab kuch jaanne wala hai.", "3", "Abu Dawud; At-Tirmidhi (Hisn al-Muslim 86)"),
   ("Asking Allah to set every affair right", "يا حَيُّ يا قَيّومُ بِرَحْمَتِكَ أَسْتَغيث ، أَصْلِحْ لي شَأْني كُلَّه ، وَلا تَكِلني إِلى نَفْسي طَرْفَةَ عَين",
    "Yā ḥayyu yā qayyūm, biraḥmatika astaghīth, aṣliḥ lī sha'nī kullah, wa lā takilnī ilā nafsī ṭarfata `ayn.",
    "O Ever-Living, O Sustainer of all, by Your mercy I call for help. Set all my affairs right, and do not leave me to myself even for the blink of an eye.",
    "Ae hamesha zinda rehne wale, ae sab ko qaim rakhne wale, Teri rehmat ke wasile se main madad mangta hoon. Mere saare kaam durust farma de, aur mujhe palak jhapakne ke barabar bhi mere nafs ke hawale na kar.", "1", "Al-Hakim, graded authentic (Hisn al-Muslim 88)"),
   ("Glorifying Allah", "سُبْحانَ اللهِ وَبِحَمْدِهِ", "Subḥānallāhi wa biḥamdih.",
    "Glory be to Allah and all praise is His.", "Allah paak hai aur tamam tareef Usi ki hai.", "100", "Sahih Muslim (Hisn al-Muslim 91)"),
   ("Evening protection", "أَعوذُ بِكَلِماتِ اللّهِ التّامّاتِ مِنْ شَرِّ ما خَلَق", "A`ūdhu bikalimātillāhit-tāmmāti min sharri mā khalaq.",
    "I seek protection in the perfect words of Allah from the evil of what He has created.", "Main Allah ke mukammal kalimaat ki panah mangta hoon har us cheez ki buraai se jo Us ne paida ki.", "3 (evening)", "Sahih Muslim (Hisn al-Muslim 97)"),
